Z||000007||artherd||09-16-2001||11:03 PM||||mmm.  Fierostore is your best bet for a 'new stock performance' setup, you can get all koni (WORTH IT) for about $1k.<P>Other than that, there's Held Motorsports for the ultimate kit.  You can go as far as you want, but it'll cost $.<P>It sounds like you don't just have a bad car, but a VERY dangerous one.   Keep in mind you are going to need to replace *all* bushings (cradle bushings too if you car is non-88, I'd replace with solid...) <P><BR>You're not going to belive the difference!<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
